5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-20T12:17:47Z","updated_at":"2026-01-20T12:17:47Z","body":"The FPS difference looks drastic, but it's a 1.42 ms difference. From my investigation, this seems to be caused by the Vulkan NVIDIA driver delegating the costly `vkQueueSubmit` call to a separate worker thread, which does not happen with the D3D12 `ExecuteCommandLists`/`Present` equivalents. I'm not sure about the implications of that for input latency or frame pacing.\n\nFor reference, D3D12 is 2~ ms faster on my AMD APU.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3772605488/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3772634722","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115167#issuecomment-3772634722","issue_url":"https://